export default App;

To fix the issue where the notification says "0 items restocked" despite items being returned to inventory, I will update `App.tsx`.

The problem is that the `restockedCount` variable was being updated inside the `setProducts` state setter (which runs asynchronously/later), but was being read immediately for the toast notification. I will move the calculation to happen synchronously before the state updates.

